    mrs:nonReportBasis "Ubaydah b. al-Harith fought in the pre-battle triple duel (with Hamza and Ali) against three Qurashi champions; he was mortally wounded (his leg severed) and died of the wound shortly afterward, on the return march. Widely repeated in the standard sira tradition, not yet matched to a specific passage."@en ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy act:4bVcX7zAsD2fGhJ9kQwErTy .


#################################################################
#  §4  ABSENT FROM BADR — the notable non-participants
#
#  mrs:rel_absent_from exists precisely for this: absence is often the
#  historically notable claim, and a model that can only record
#  presence cannot represent it (docs/02 §9).
#################################################################

