#  §8  FURTHER EVENTS — the same 35 people, across their whole
#      documented era rather than a single moment
#
#  Direction: keep the person roster fixed (per user direction, 12
#  Sept 2026); deepen the network by adding real, well-documented
#  events spanning 3–11 AH, so the same people accumulate genuine
#  ties to each other across a life, not one battle. A person already
#  dead by a given event is never listed as attending it — checked
#  explicitly below for each addition.
#################################################################

