# membership among the still-living 35, on the strength that the pledge is
# widely described as near-universal among those present (traditions vary
# on exact numbers, commonly ~1,400). Individual confirmation per person is
# not established at this coverage level.

ast:7yUmK3jHgF9dSaQ2wErT504 a mrs:Assertion ; mrs:coverageState mrs:cs_stub ;
    mrs:createdBy agt:9wErT4yUmN7bVcX2zAsDfGh ; mrs:recordedAt "2026-09-13T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    mrs:predicate mrs:rel_absent_from ; mrs:assertionSubject per:8gY3kPcU5nR8yAdW3jS9eE1 ;
    mrs:assertionObject ev:9qWeR4tYuP7aSdF3gHjKzX3 ; mrs:assertionStatus mrs:as_proposed ;
    mrs:nonReportBasis "Uthman was sent by the Prophet as an envoy to the Quraysh in Makkah during this expedition; his delay caused rumour of his death, prompting the Pledge itself. The Prophet reportedly struck his own hand as a pledge made on Uthman's behalf. He was present at the wider expedition but absent from the pledge under the tree. Standard tradition; not yet matched to a specific passage."@en ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy act:4bVcX7zAsD2fGhJ9kQwErTy .

